currency CHF 0.01

account assets:cash
account expenses:vat
  + assert virtual-allowed
account income:gifts

2025-01-27
  | Both scopes on one account, with different answers
  * assets:cash  +100.00 CHF
  * income:gifts -105.00 CHF
